        <section class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-5 md:px-8 pt-10 md:pt-16 pb-16">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-100 text-[13px] text-emerald-800 mb-6"><span class="bg-emerald-500 text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold">LEARN</span>7 Guides for Beginners — Click any guide to read</div>
            <h1 class="text-[34px] md:text-[48px] font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[0.95] max-w-[640px]">Everything you need to build credit from <span class="text-emerald-500">0.</span></h1>
            <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] leading-7 text-slate-500 max-w-[480px]">No jargon. No affiliate-first rankings. Guides written by former CFPB analyst, reviewed by CFA. Click a guide to start.</p>
            <div class="mt-10 grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                <button onclick="openGuideModal('what_is_score')" class="text-left rounded-[20px] border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgba(15,23,42,0.08)] hover:border-slate-900 transition">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-[14px]">1</div>
                    <h3 class="mt-4 font-bold text-[18px]">What is a Credit Score?</h3>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-[13px] text-slate-500 leading-6">FICO vs VantageScore, why 0 is normal, and what 300-850 means.</p>
                    <div class="mt-4 text-[12px] font-bold">5 min read → Click to read</div>
                </button>
                <button onclick="openGuideModal('first_card')" class="text-left rounded-[20px] border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgba(15,23,42,0.08)] hover:border-emerald-500 transition bg-emerald-50/30 border-emerald-100">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-[14px]">2</div>
                    <h3 class="mt-4 font-bold text-[18px]">First Card With No History</h3>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-[13px] text-slate-500 leading-6">Self, Chime, Kikoff compared — which approves you today.</p>
                    <div class="mt-4 text-[12px] font-bold text-emerald-600">Most popular → Click to compare</div>
                </button>
                <button onclick="openGuideModal('rent_reporting')" class="text-left rounded-[20px] border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgba(15,23,42,0.08)] hover:border-slate-900 transition">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-[14px]">3</div>
                    <h3 class="mt-4 font-bold text-[18px]">Rent Reporting</h3>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-[13px] text-slate-500 leading-6">Can paying rent boost your score? +12 points explained.</p>
                    <div class="mt-4 text-[12px] font-bold">4 min read → Click to read</div>
                </button>
                <button onclick="openGuideModal('utilization')" class="text-left rounded-[20px] border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgba(15,23,42,0.08)] hover:border-slate-900 transition">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-[14px]">4</div>
                    <h3 class="mt-4 font-bold text-[18px]">Utilization Rule: 30%</h3>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-[13px] text-slate-500 leading-6">Why you should never use more than 30% of your limit.</p>
                    <div class="mt-4 text-[12px] font-bold">3 min read → Click to read</div>
                </button>
                <button onclick="openGuideModal('scams')" class="text-left rounded-[20px] border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgba(15,23,42,0.08)] hover:border-slate-900 transition">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-[14px]">5</div>
                    <h3 class="mt-4 font-bold text-[18px]">Avoid Credit Repair Scams</h3>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-[13px] text-slate-500 leading-6">5 red flags the CFPB warns about.</p>
                    <div class="mt-4 text-[12px] font-bold">6 min read → Click to read</div>
                </button>
                <div class="rounded-[20px] bg-slate-900 text-white p-6 flex flex-col justify-center">
                    <div class="text-[18px] font-bold">Test your knowledge</div>
                    <p class="text-[13px] text-slate-400 mt-2 leading-6">Take the free 2-min quiz and get your build plan.</p>
                    <a href="/#calculators" class="mt-5 h-11 px-6 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-600 text-white font-semibold text-[14px] flex items-center justify-center">Open Calculator →</a>
                    <a href="/Pages/CreditCards" class="mt-3 h-11 px-6 rounded-full bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white font-semibold text-[14px] flex items-center justify-center border border-white/20">Compare Cards →</a>
